# Swift iOS Architecture

- Use SwiftUI for views and keep views lightweight.
- Put app logic into view models, services, and orchestrators.
- All STT, LLM, TTS, and audio components must sit behind protocols.
- Use dependency injection via initializers.
- Prefer async/await and AsyncStream.
- Keep AVAudioEngine and model inference off the main thread.
- Use MainActor only for UI-facing state changes.
- Keep new types small and single-purpose.
- Avoid global singletons unless unavoidable.